---
.title = "WebRTC: peer-to-peer for the browser",
.description = "WebRTC carries a pancake session over an encrypted DataChannel, with direct browser-to-browser channels after signaling.",
.date = @date("2026-07-22T00:00:00"),
.author = "Jim Isaacs",
